{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/b30b246313dff4a561e24d0b95511ec8.avif?t=1757670990\" width=1000 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vaifurion is a cozy blend of idle progression, card collecting, and RPG mechanics. Click, collect, and unlock over <strong>1,000</strong> beautifully illustrated waifu cards, some with stunning holographic effects, while enjoying a <strong>chill</strong>, <strong>ambient experience</strong>. Explore the world of Vaifurion \u2014 a realm shaped by flame, frost, shadow, and light \u2014 where the resurfacing of the mythical Eclipse Crown has set countless heroines on a path toward power, purpose, or ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/1a162f23611415cda3e871f30408b9e1.poster.avif?t=1757670990\" width=1024 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/1a162f23611415cda3e871f30408b9e1.webm?t=1757670990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/1a162f23611415cda3e871f30408b9e1.mp4?t=1757670990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/35b7c2b0ffb4cd567ead4204f29c75f0.avif?t=1757670990\" width=1000 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/4e4b5b937f291952020da4c2f83fef7e.avif?t=1757670990\" width=1536 height=808 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/17093f8dd18557bb1dae60d2069afda1.avif?t=1757670990\" width=1000 height=760 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/46251ccdab33f614a7c69a2e5ba30adc.avif?t=1757670990\" width=1000 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across its continents, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>many distinct races</strong>, each with their own culture, powers, and secrets. From the radiant <strong>Sunchosen</strong> and enigmatic <strong>Netherbinders</strong>, to the playful <strong>Slimekin</strong> and fierce <strong>Flame Succubi</strong>, every card you collect tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know\u00a0<strong>unique regions</strong>, from the volcanic <strong>Ashen Peaks</strong> to the twilight-cloaked <strong>Nightspire Hollow</strong>, the glowing <strong>Emerald Vale</strong>, and storm-ravaged <strong>Tempest Isles</strong>. Each area with its unique story and mystery \u2014 and all are connected by whispers of the <strong>Eclipse Crown</strong>, a forgotten relic that could reshape the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/7fa359569e3bbce1a400034c661249c4.poster.avif?t=1757670990\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/7fa359569e3bbce1a400034c661249c4.webm?t=1757670990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/7fa359569e3bbce1a400034c661249c4.mp4?t=1757670990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragra